#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Cacti records this outcome before verifying account enabled, realm authorization, or 2FA completion; a session may not have been established."
msgstr "Cacti yana rubuta wannan sakamakon kafin ya tabbatar da cewa an kunna asusun, izinin yanki, ko kammala 2FA; ƙila ba a kafa zama ba tukuna."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "No current Cacti path writes this signature; recorded defensively as a possible password change with an unconfirmed outcome."
msgstr "Babu wata hanyar Cacti ta yanzu da ke rubuta wannan sa hannun; an rubuta shi a matsayin kariya a kan yiwuwar sauyin kalmar sirri wanda ba a tabbatar da sakamakonsa ba."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Cacti user_log result=3 with user_id=0 may be a password change or a failed 2FA challenge; the table cannot disambiguate."
msgstr "Sakamakon Cacti user_log result=3 tare da user_id=0 na iya zama sauyin kalmar sirri ko ƙalubalen 2FA da ya gaza; teburin ba zai iya rarrabewa ba."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Audit administration permission is required to save these settings."
msgstr "Ana buƙatar izinin gudanar da bincike don ajiye waɗannan saituna."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Authentication auditing was not enabled. Run the audit_auth_indexes.php CLI maintenance command first."
msgstr "Ba a kunna binciken tabbatar da shaida ba. Da farko gudanar da umarnin kulawa na CLI audit_auth_indexes.php."

