#: setup.php
msgid "Allows Administrators to view change activity on the Cacti server.  Administrators can also export the audit log for analysis purposes."
msgstr "Yana ba wa Masu Gudanarwa damar duba ayyukan sauyi a kan sabar Cacti. Masu Gudanarwa za su iya fitar da rajistar bincike don dalilan nazari."

#: setup.php
